WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Customer · Samsung Android: Choose your pickup and destination. Database-backed places and a bundled map.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Customer · Samsung Android: See the road fare before requesting. Cash, service terms and your chosen vehicle.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Driver · Android emulator: The assigned driver confirms arrival. Separate accounts. Assigned-driver controls.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Driver · Android emulator: The driver validates the customer’s PIN. Customer screens never expose a Start ride button.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Customer · Samsung Android: Your cash confirmation is recorded. The completed trip remains in your history.
